{"metadata":{"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"slug":[{"Plain":"零调对象"},0],"title":[{"Plain":"零调对象"},2],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>在"},{"Local":{"url":"意象","text":"意象"}},{"Plain":"中, 若对象 $X$ 满足 $* \\sqcup_X * = *$, 则称其为<strong>零调对象</strong> (acyclic object).</p>\n<h2>性质</h2>\n"}]}}